---
title: Which ballot counts for a lot in the committee election (s 87 — one ballot per lot)
---
flowchart TD
    L["Lot X · election ballot<br/>window open"] --> A{"Owner present in meeting<br/>(in person / video / phone)?"}
    A -- Yes --> OV["Owner's live chat ballot counts.<br/>Any proxy or pre-vote for the lot is<br/>inoperative for this meeting (s 89E)"]
    A -- No --> B{"Operative verified proxy<br/>for the lot present?"}
    B -- Yes --> PV["Proxy's chat ballot counts<br/>(directed proxy: ballots as directed)"]
    B -- No --> C{"Verified pre-vote ballot on file<br/>(only if pre-voting permitted)?"}
    C -- Yes --> PRV["Pre-vote ballot counts"]
    C -- No --> NV["No ballot recorded for the lot"]
    OV --> G{"s 89B gate:<br/>lot in arrears?"}
    PV --> G
    PRV --> G
    G -- "Yes — ballot blocked<br/>(unless paid in full ≥4 business<br/>days prior, or cash)" --> BLK["Recorded as invalid<br/>with reason code s 89B"]
    G -- No --> VAL{"Ballot valid?<br/>≤7 candidates · names on the<br/>verified candidate list ·<br/>duplicates counted once"}
    VAL -- "Defect — RO prompts in chat,<br/>voter may resubmit in window" --> VAL
    VAL -- "Still defective at close" --> BLK2["Invalid · reason code"]
    VAL -- Yes --> CNT["Ballot counted:<br/>1 per lot (s 87) · one COUNTIF<br/>per candidate · × lot entitlement<br/>if poll demanded (s 89(3))"]
    CNT --> DUP["Duplicate chat entries: last message<br/>in window from the operative voter counts ·<br/>conflicting persons for one lot →<br/>PROVISIONAL with reason code"]
